url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahojnnes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":414666626,"digest":"sha256:e9c5cbd84c2ea986d2e970a2473fc2d2e6b34a2cdcf5d3df2765c319a63af881","download_count":1243,"created_at":"2026-09-29T13:54:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T13:54:52Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/colmap/colmap/releases/download/4.2.1/colmap-x64-windows-cuda.zip"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colmap/colmap/releases/assets/598346777","id":598346777,"node_id":"RA_kwDOAV8Quc4jqgwZ","name":"colmap-x64-windows-nocuda.zip","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"ahojnnes","id":134307,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDMwNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahojnnes","html_url":"https://github.com/ahojnnes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahojnnes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahojnnes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahojnnes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahojnnes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahojnnes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahojnnes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahojnnes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahojnnes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahojnnes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":127731595,"digest":"sha256:c493d88cb4a43f21afba42cb55bf786e5434a0420e73db0ba1454c5d8b3686ae","download_count":409,"created_at":"2026-09-29T13:54:09Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T13:54:31Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/colmap/colmap/releases/download/4.2.1/colmap-x64-windows-nocuda.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colmap/colmap/tarball/4.2.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colmap/colmap/zipball/4.2.1","body":"Bug Fixes\r\n---------\r\n* Fix non-terminating Delaunay meshing (and unbounded memory growth) when a\r\n  3D point coincides with a camera center. Observations without a viewing\r\n  direction are skipped and the ray walk is bounded.\r\n* Fix GPU memory leak in LoMa matching by upgrading ONNX Runtime to 1.30.0.\r\n* Fix darkened 3D point colors after track merging by treating black as\r\n  \"not yet colored\" in ``Reconstruction::MergePoints3D``.\r\n* Fix the hash-map backend being derived from the build machine's Boost\r\n  version, which made same-source builds ABI-incompatible and could corrupt\r\n  memory. The backend now defaults to ``STD`` and mismatches are reported\r\n  at configure time.\r\n* Restore legacy bundle-adjustment behavior in the global mapper, fixing a\r\n  regression introduced in 4.2.0. The inner L2 retriangulation refinement\r\n  additionally keeps camera poses and intrinsics fixed, optimizing only 3D\r\n  points, so triangulation outliers can no longer corrupt the cameras.\r\n* Fix LO-RANSAC local optimization running below the estimator sample\r\n  minimum.\r\n* Fix CUDA illegal memory access in image rotate/transpose/flip kernels for\r\n  large images by computing pitched row offsets in ``size_t``.\r\n* Fix PoissonRecon binary PLY corruption and crashes caused by inconsistent\r\n  endianness initialization across translation units.\r\n* Honor ``TwoViewGeometry.min_inlier_ratio`` consistently in the\r\n  uncalibrated, forced-homography, and rig estimation paths.\r\n* Clear payloads of ``DEGENERATE`` two-view geometries during verification\r\n  and skip ``UNDEFINED``/``DEGENERATE`` pairs when loading the database\r\n  cache, so rejected pairs no longer flow into the mappers.\r\n* Prefer reference sensor poses when converting database images to rig\r\n  frames, avoiding inconsistent shared rig poses.\r\n* Fix dropped ``THROW_CHECK`` messages with recent glog versions and unify\r\n  full-precision text stream configuration.\r\n* Fix a race condition in download-cache directory creation during parallel\r\n  downloads.\r\n* Fix the image triangulator progress counter.\r\n* Fix missing pycolmap method-chaining overrides and NumPy stub annotations.\r\n* Keep at least one panorama rendering worker.\r\n* Fix builds without OpenMP, add missing header includes, fix a member\r\n  initialization order warning, and discard unused future return values in\r\n  the image undistorters.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colmap/colmap/releases/399189002/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":0}}